f\u88c5\u4e56\u96e2", "content_html": "HAMgrD \u306e\u5236\u9650\u4e8b\u9805\u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u4e56\u96e2\u3002community master \u4e0a\u3067 hamgrd \u30d0\u30a4\u30ca\u30ea\u672a\u53d6\u308a\u8fbc\u307f\u3001DASH_HA_DPU_STATE / VDPU_TABLE \u672a\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3001swbus \u4e0d\u5728\u3001Switch-Driven mode TBD \u306a\u3069\u3001HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u5dee\u5206\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-limitations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:40:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/", "title": "\u904b\u7528\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9", "content_html": "\u904b\u7528\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9 \u2014 \u65e2\u306b SONiC \u3092\u904b\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u8aad\u8005\u3092\u60f3\u5b9a\u3057\u305f\u5165\u53e3\u3002\u65e5\u3005\u306e\u78ba\u8a8d\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u5909\u66f4\u3001\u969c\u5bb3\u8abf\u67fb\u3001CONFIG_DB \u306e\u610f\u5473\u78ba\u8a8d\u3001show techsupport \u3084\u30ed\u30b0\u30fb\u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u306e\u4f7f\u3044\u65b9\u306b\u52a0\u3048\u3001\u75c7\u72b6\u5225\u306e\u9006\u5f15\u304d\u8868\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3067\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/operator.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:46:22+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/sonic-flexcounter-refactor/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/sonic-flexcounter-refactor/", "title": "FlexCounter \u30ea\u30d5\u30a1\u30af\u30bf\uff08CounterContext \u30c6\u30f3\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u5316\uff09", "content_html": "FlexCounter \u30ea\u30d5\u30a1\u30af\u30bf\uff08CounterContext \u30c6\u30f3\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u5316\uff09 \u2014 syncd \u306e FlexCounter \u306f port / queue / buffer pool / priority group \u306a\u3069 \u591a\u6570\u306e\u7d71\u8a08\u30fb\u5c5e\u6027\u30bf\u30a4\u30d7 \u3092\u6271\u3046\u5de8\u5927\u30af\u30e9\u30b9\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/sonic-flexcounter-refactor.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:08:40+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnoi-hld-for-system-apis/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnoi-hld-for-system-apis/", "title": "gNOI System Reboot / RebootStatus / CancelReboot\uff08reboot method \u3068 sanity check\uff09", "content_html": "gNOI System Reboot / RebootStatus / CancelReboot\uff08reboot method \u3068 sanity check\uff09 \u2014 gnoi.system.System \u306e\u3046\u3061 SONiC \u304c\u521d\u671f\u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3059\u308b RPC \u306f Reboot / RebootStatus / CancelReb\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/gnoi-hld-for-system-apis.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T16:59:25+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/vxlan-sonic-operations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/vxlan-sonic-operations/", "title": "VXLAN / VNet \u8a2d\u5b9a\u3068\u904b\u7528\uff08CONFIG_DB / APP_DB / CLI\uff09", "content_html": "VXLAN / VNet \u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7d4c\u8def\u3002CONFIG_DB / APP_DB \u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\u3001CLI \u4e00\u89a7\u3001VNet \u30d4\u30a2\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u4f8b\u3001\u904b\u7528\u6642\u306e\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u624b\u9806\u3092\u6271\u3046\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/overlay/vxlan-sonic-operations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:40:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/vlan-tagging/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/vlan-tagging/", "title": "VLAN \u30e1\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u3092\u8ffd\u52a0\u3057\u3066\u3082\u30bf\u30b0\u304c\u4ed8\u304b\u306a\u3044", "content_html": "Runbook: VLAN \u30e1\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u3092\u8ffd\u52a0\u3057\u3066\u3082\u30bf\u30b0\u304c\u4ed8\u304b\u306a\u3044\u75c7\u72b6\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051\u3002CONFIG_DB / APPL_DB / ASIC_DB \u304a\u3088\u3073 kernel bridge \u3067\u306e\u78ba\u8a8d\u624b\u9806\u3068\u3001\u5225 VLAN untagged \u591a\u91cd\u8a2d\u5b9a\u304c config vlan member add -u \u3067\u660e\u793a\u5931\u6557\u3059\u308b\u6319\u52d5\u306e\u8aac\u660e\u3002sonic-swss vlanmgrd / sonic-utilities config vlan member \u3092\u5f15\u7528\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/vlan-tagging.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T06:30:01+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "title": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09", "content_html": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09 \u2014 verification: discrepancy-found \u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u305f\u5168\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092 monitor subtype \u5225\u306b\u5206\u985e\u3057\u305f\u4e00\u89a7\u3002meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py \u3067\u751f\u6210\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:19:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-banner/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-banner/", "title": "sonic-banner YANG", "content_html": "sonic-banner YANG \u2014 Login, MOTD, and logout banner message YANG module for SONiC OS.", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-banner.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:01:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-queue/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-queue/", "title": "sonic-queue YANG", "content_html": "sonic-queue YANG \u2014 egress queue \u3054\u3068\u306e scheduler / wred_profile \u7d10\u4ed8\u3051 (QUEUE_LIST \u3068 VOQ_QUEUE_LIST \u306e switch_type \u5206\u5c90)", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-queue.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:33:01+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/detailed-steps-to-upgrade-frr-in-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/detailed-steps-to-upgrade-frr-in-sonic/", "title": "SONiC \u306b\u304a\u3051\u308b FRR upgrade \u306e\u624b\u9806\u3068\u30d1\u30c3\u30c1\u7ba1\u7406", "content_html": "SONiC \u306b\u304a\u3051\u308b FRR upgrade \u306e\u624b\u9806\u3068\u30d1\u30c3\u30c1\u7ba1\u7406 \u2014 SONiC \u306f upstream frrouting/frr \u3092 branch \u30b9\u30ca\u30c3\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 + per-release patch \u96c6 \u3068\u3044\u3046\u5f62\u3067\u53d6\u308a\u8fbc\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/detailed-steps-to-upgrade-frr-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T01:32:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/high-level-design-document/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/high-level-design-document/", "title": "Ordered ECMP\uff08nexthop \u306b sequence_id \u3092\u4ed8\u3051\u540c\u4e00\u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u3092\u540c ToR \u306b\u56fa\u5b9a\uff09", "content_html": "Ordered ECMP \u306f nexthop \u3092 IP \u6607\u9806\u3067\u4e26\u3079 SAI \u306b sequence_id \u4ed8\u304d\u3067\u6295\u5165\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3001\u5168 T1 \u304b\u3089\u540c\u3058\u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u3092\u5fc5\u305a\u540c\u3058 T0 \u306b landing \u3055\u305b\u3001flow state \u3092\u6301\u3064 appliance \u30da\u30a2\u3067\u306e state miss \u3092\u9632\u3050\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/high-level-design-document.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T20:20:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/", "title": "VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB \u30d1\u30a4\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3", "content_html": "VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB \u30d1\u30a4\u30d7\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3 \u2014 SONiC \u306e L3 \u8ee2\u9001\u3092\u300cVRF \u3068 interface \u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u300d\u300croute \u304c FRR \u304b\u3089 APPL_DB \u306b\u6765\u308b\u300d\u300corchagent \u304c RIF / next hop / route object \u3092 ASIC \u306b\u4f5c\u308b\u300d\u300cECMP \u306e\u7a2e\u985e\u3092\u9078\u3076\u300d\u306e\u9806\u3067\u8aad\u307f\u76f4\u3059\u7ae0\u5165\u53e3\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:53:10+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/07-acl-copp-mirror/architecture/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/07-acl-copp-mirror/architecture/", "title": "\u30a2\u30fc\u30ad\u30c6\u30af\u30c1\u30e3", "content_html": "\u30a2\u30fc\u30ad\u30c6\u30af\u30c1\u30e3 \u2014 ACL \u306e\u4e2d\u5fc3\u306f AclOrch \u3067\u3059\u3002\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306f CONFIG_DB \u304b\u3089\u5165\u308a\u3001APPL_DB \u3092\u7d4c\u7531\u3057\u3066 AclOrch \u304c SAI ACL table\u3001entry\u3001counter \u306b\u5909\u63db\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/07-acl-copp-mirror/architecture.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:53:02+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "title": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG", "content_html": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e\u300c\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u99c6\u52d5\u7ba1\u7406\u300d\u3092\u3001\u30ea\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u5165\u308b\u5165\u53e3\u304b\u3089 ConfigDB \u306b\u5230\u9054\u3059\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306e\u9806\u3067\u8aad\u307f\u76f4\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/concept/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/concept/", "title": "\u6982\u8981", "content_html": "\u6982\u8981 \u2014 SONiC \u306e\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u99c6\u52d5\u7ba1\u7406\u306f\u3001CLI\u3001gNMI\u3001REST \u3068\u3044\u3046 3 \u3064\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u304c\u3001Translib / Transformer \u3068\u3044\u3046\u5171\u901a\u306e\u4e2d\u9593\u5c64\u3092\u901a\u3063\u3066 ConfigDB \u3078\u5230\u9054\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u4f5c\u3089\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/concept.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T15:44:39+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}